      "id": "claim_ee8d1e7910ce44b59945ef747f336042",
      "statement": "The test-flow JSON contract is version 1 with optional name and conditions plus required non-empty measurements; the loader rejects malformed shape, types, empty lists, unknown metrics, and duplicate targets/readings, and resets the parsed spec on any load failure.",
