      "id": "claim_9ba17c8216a74c878a599d76dbd6aa3a",
      "statement": "Flow component references use IComponentEngine::id(), not graph-node IDs, and the harness/panel resolve them by scanning live engines. CircuitRuntime allocates IDs monotonically and removing a live component does not renumber survivors; project replacement resets the counter and reconstructs components in saved order, so deletion or reordering before a save/load can make old flow IDs missing or bind them to a different engine.",
